      "title": "Fix C6323: \"Use of arithmetic operator on Boolean type(s)\".",
      "message": "Fix C6323: \"Use of arithmetic operator on Boolean type(s)\".\n\nThe VC++ analyzer reports several instances of warning C6323 for the use of\narithmetic operators on Boolean types.\n\nIn each case, the Boolean value is being multiplied by two.  \"boolVal * 2\" can\nbe trivially replaced with \"boolVal ? 2 : 0\".\n",
